@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Employee
participant ":System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : asks to assign a selected train to a route
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows list avilable and asks to select one
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects a train
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows list avilable station
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : define the route (order list of station)
    activate System

        System --> System : shecks connectivity between consecutive stations
    deactivate System

  alt invalid path between two stations
        System --> Player :  warns player to crate a route and asks to confirm (cancel or proceed)
        Player -> System :  chooses to continue or cancel
    end

        System --> Employee : ask for cargo list per station
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : assigns cargo types (multiple cargo types allowed)
    activate System

    System--> Employee :confirms successful route and cargo assigment

@enduml